{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16754","headline":"寓居武丁馆 · 陈存","name":"寓居武丁馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暑雨飘已过，凉飙触幽衿。\n虚馆无喧尘，绿槐多昼阴。\n俯视古苔积，仰聆早蝉吟。\n放卷一长想，闭门千里心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}